---
title: ":leafy_green: Spinach Cheese Squares"
source: Recipe Box
servings: 12
prep time: 15 minutes
cook time: 35 minutes
total time: 60 minutes
tags:
  - lunches
  - spinach
  - cheese
  - recipe-box
  - vegetarian
---

Preheat oven to 350°F. Place @margarine{4%Tbsp} in a #9x13-inch baking pan{} and melt in the oven.

In a #large bowl{}, whisk together @eggs{3}, @all-purpose flour{1%cup}, @milk{1%cup}, @salt{1%tsp}, and @baking powder{1%tsp}.

Stir in shredded @sharp cheddar cheese{1%lb} and thawed, drained @frozen chopped spinach{20%oz}.

Pour mixture into the prepared pan. Bake for ~{35%minutes}.

Remove and allow to cool for ~{10%minutes} before cutting into squares.
